        <helpText>Disable a user account by setting the password to an unknown value. 

This escalation has a very strong qualifier; we err on the side of not disabling an account rather than disabling an account that should not be disabled.  In addition to the time period to disablement having passed, the following password policy fields cannot be NULL:

zPasswordEnforcementEnabled (global password policy is enforced)
Force Password Change (flag redirecting a user to the password change form)
zDays After Expiration Until Disablement (period of time after expiration before disablement)
Account Disabled Date (timestamp setting date on which the account should be disabled)</helpText>
